				{
					"summary": "canvist runs in React Native and Lynx apps",
					"details_markdown": "##### User impact\n\nApps built with React Native or Lynx can now add canvist's editor. It is the same native editor as on iOS and Android, so typing, autocorrect, dictation, selection, and screen readers work as people expect, not like a web page squeezed into an app. Both are previews for now: they install from GitHub rather than npm.",
