					"summary": "Type in the docs' previews and see who's editing",
					"details_markdown": "##### User impact\n\nWhen you run a sample in the docs, the document it makes opens in a real editor you can type in, whichever extensions it uses. In the playground, the Every extension document is editable too, and in the Collaboration example each person's cursor shows in the other editors with their name, so you can watch someone type.",
